    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d311">

                <pb facs="0441" n="359" sameAs="frus:frus1925v02/pg359"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">865.51/448: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Fletcher</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-06-02T11:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 2, 1925—11
                                a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received June 2—7:56 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>85. Banking credit contract for 50 million dollars referred to in Department’s
                    telegram No. 63 of May 29, 7 p.m.,<anchor n="1a" xml:id="d311-f1"/> was signed
                    last night, and the transaction will be publicly announced to the Parliament by
                    the Minister of Finance this afternoon.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fletcher</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
